1
00:00:31,968 --> 00:00:34,873
=Love Actually S5 Extra Episode=

2
00:00:35,488 --> 00:00:37,680
(The Night Before Confession)

3
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,319
Have you finished writing it?

4
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:39,599
Yes, I'm done.

5
00:00:39,599 --> 00:00:40,439
I'm not going to read it.

6
00:00:41,319 --> 00:00:42,599
It's for everyone.

7
00:00:42,599 --> 00:00:43,799
Mine is for everyone, too.

8
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,840
If we keep writing about us,

9
00:00:46,319 --> 00:00:47,360
everyone will roast us hard.

10
00:00:48,096 --> 00:00:50,016
(Too much PDA)

11
00:00:50,319 --> 00:00:51,560
Did you eat anything this afternoon?

12
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:53,840
I just had a few chips.

13
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,200
We're genuinely just waiting for dinner.

14
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,759
I'm waiting for dinner tonight, too.

15
00:00:58,919 --> 00:00:59,759
During our first dinner,

16
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:00,720
we were seated far apart.

17
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:03,599
Let's sit closer for dinner tonight.

18
00:01:03,599 --> 00:01:04,480
Side by side.

19
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,599
Then I'll share a chair with you.

20
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:07,879
Okay.

21
00:01:09,199 --> 00:01:09,800
Done?

22
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:11,839
Eloquent writing.

23
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,480
Look at my hearts.

24
00:01:16,203 --> 00:01:18,000
(Wang Yi's exclusive note to everyone)

25
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:18,319
Good.

26
00:01:19,599 --> 00:01:20,959
Why did you change into
a whole new outfit after coming back?

27
00:01:21,984 --> 00:01:24,400
I feel like I have to wear this now,
or I won't get the chance.

28
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,480
You've never worn this before.

29
00:01:26,919 --> 00:01:28,080
Doesn't it look like a host's outfit?

30
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:31,000
(Cardcaptor Yi)
Here is a news bulletin for everyone.

31
00:01:32,928 --> 00:01:35,319
Lu Bingkun is about to wrap up
this chapter of his journey,

32
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:37,319
and embark on a new adventure
alongside Wang Yi.

33
00:01:37,879 --> 00:01:38,599
What?

34
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:39,720
You really wrote that?

35
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,480
No way.

36
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,239
One, two, three, four.

37
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:48,040
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight,

38
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,400
nine, ten, eleven, twelve.

39
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:51,440
Look.

40
00:01:53,839 --> 00:01:54,919
Twelve hearts.

41
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,959
You and I are surrounded.

42
00:01:58,239 --> 00:01:59,360
I'm this one, and you're this one.

43
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:01,680
What are you doing?

44
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:04,440
You've got me soft.

45
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,040
Call me Little Cake.

46
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:06,879
Little Cake.

47
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:08,759
Big Cake.

48
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,520
Tiramisu.

49
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,479
Little Pudding.

50
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:14,880
Do you like tiramisu?

51
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,919
I like egg tarts.

52
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:27,119
Full of gains.

53
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:30,679
Let's see your little house.

54
00:02:30,679 --> 00:02:31,160
Little house.

55
00:02:32,679 --> 00:02:33,559
I really like this little house.

56
00:02:37,839 --> 00:02:38,839
It's great. I love it.

57
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:44,039
It's good.

58
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:45,080
Oh my God.

59
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,520
This fan is absolutely amazing.

60
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,160
It's amazing.

61
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:48,800
Absolutely incredible.

62
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,119
You are incredible, too.

63
00:02:50,119 --> 00:02:50,720
You couldn't

64
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:51,720
be more incredible.

65
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:57,520
Liu.

66
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,360
Can I go check it over there?

67
00:02:59,360 --> 00:02:59,600
Over there.

68
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,360
(Unfair)
Why's only mine shown to everyone?

69
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,479
You've got to show yours too.

70
00:03:02,479 --> 00:03:04,360
I'll sneak off to check it out with her.

71
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,720
What is this?

72
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,600
They are so beautiful.

73
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,679
I specifically wrapped this crystal

74
00:03:13,679 --> 00:03:14,880
together with jade.

75
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,559
Well.

76
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,440
Because we

77
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:20,479
met in Sanya,

78
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:22,080
and for the feeling you gave me...

79
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,160
Do you remember
the first day you arrived?

80
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,000
I said you looked like a flower fairy

81
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,639
in this pink dress.

82
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,160
I thought you were stunning back then,

83
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,759
just like this conch

84
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:32,759
listening quietly to all my words.

85
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,720
So I think for us two,

86
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:37,839
it holds a special meaning.

87
00:03:37,839 --> 00:03:38,119
So I...

88
00:03:38,839 --> 00:03:39,720
That's why I told you

89
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,720
to check it when you're alone.

90
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,199
Thank you.

91
00:03:43,679 --> 00:03:44,839
Just for us to peek,
nobody else gets to see.

92
00:03:44,839 --> 00:03:45,240
Sneak a peek.

93
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:45,839
This one is also very pretty.

94
00:03:45,839 --> 00:03:46,199
Let me see.

95
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,399
It's so beautiful.

96
00:03:50,399 --> 00:03:50,919
I'll put it out when I get back.

97
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:52,240
It's upright.

98
00:03:54,279 --> 00:03:55,000
Flower fairy.

99
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,080
Thank you, sweetheart.

100
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,800
So happy.

101
00:03:59,839 --> 00:04:00,559
Put it away quickly.

102
00:04:02,559 --> 00:04:03,279
Later tonight,

103
00:04:03,279 --> 00:04:04,479
once I'm tucked in bed,

104
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:05,240
I'll let myself tear up silently,

105
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:06,880
moved deep down inside.

106
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:08,759
Wait.

107
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:10,440
I haven't finished giving you gifts yet.

108
00:04:11,119 --> 00:04:11,960
I've got one more for you.

109
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,600
Thank you.

110
00:04:13,559 --> 00:04:14,880
It's that coconut shell.

111
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:15,600
Yes.

112
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,480
Fruit wind chime.

113
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,480
Thank you, dear.

114
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:20,399
Hui.

115
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:21,760
Thank you.

116
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:22,839
Thank you, Danqi.

117
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:25,160
Thank you.

118
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,880
Thank you, Danqi.

119
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:26,760
Thank you, Danqi.

120
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,880
This smells so good.

121
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,799
This smells really nice.

122
00:04:31,239 --> 00:04:32,720
I'm going to hang it by my bed.

123
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,200
And this sound

124
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,320
is so soothing.

125
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,160
Yeah.

126
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:36,760
So pretty.

127
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,359
It's very soothing.

128
00:04:40,239 --> 00:04:41,000
It carried healing power by itself.

129
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:42,559
Thanks.

130
00:04:45,536 --> 00:04:47,000
(For the special you)

131
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,200
Do you have a phone charging cable?

132
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,679
Yes. Are you going upstairs to get it?

133
00:04:55,082 --> 00:04:59,040
(Everyone leaves the dining hall
one by one)

134
00:05:16,679 --> 00:05:17,399
I...

135
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:26,359
I really don't want, on the last day...

136
00:05:29,799 --> 00:05:31,000
I hope our last day

137
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,279
is filled with joy.

138
00:05:32,799 --> 00:05:33,720
I want

139
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,959
everyone to remember me

140
00:05:35,959 --> 00:05:38,119
as happy and cheerful

141
00:05:38,119 --> 00:05:39,519
in this house.

142
00:05:39,519 --> 00:05:41,399
I don't want to show

143
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,480
how emotional or sad I truly am.

144
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,440
But...

145
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,679
But deep down, I truly

146
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:53,239
hate parting with everyone,

147
00:05:53,239 --> 00:05:54,200
every single one of them.

148
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,640
I never expected this.

149
00:05:56,279 --> 00:05:59,119
I always try to strike a balance

150
00:05:59,119 --> 00:06:00,399
in a close relationship,

151
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:01,519
keeping a middle ground,

152
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,720
neither too attached nor too distant.

153
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,079
But things have unexpectedly

154
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:05,760
swung entirely to one side.

155
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,440
And then...

156
00:06:09,119 --> 00:06:09,519
Well...

157
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:13,119
I lost control for a second

158
00:06:13,119 --> 00:06:14,279
and cried.

159
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,119
(I didn't want to cry in front of them.)

160
00:06:31,119 --> 00:06:32,279
(They would definitely
rush over to comfort me,)

161
00:06:32,279 --> 00:06:32,959
(telling me)

162
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,200
(not to be upset.)

163
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,839
(But I don't need anyone's consolation.)

164
00:06:36,839 --> 00:06:38,040
(I know)

165
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,799
(I can pull myself together)

166
00:06:39,799 --> 00:06:40,399
(and calm my emotions.)

167
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:42,640
(I don't want anyone thinking)

168
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:43,920
(I cried,)

169
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,399
(and I need comforting.)

170
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,279
(I don't want that.)

171
00:06:48,519 --> 00:06:49,399
Ms. Xuan.

172
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,640
Ms. Xuan.

173
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:54,079
Ms. Xuan.

174
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:00,679
Are you playing door god?

175
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,799
Are you playing door god here?

176
00:07:03,799 --> 00:07:04,920
Are you both here for fun?

177
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:07,320
Aren't you two causing trouble?

178
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:09,399
Are you playing door god?

179
00:07:12,519 --> 00:07:13,079
What's wrong with you?

180
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:15,119
Are you feeling down today?

181
00:07:15,119 --> 00:07:16,160
No, I'm not.

182
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:16,839
No?

183
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,799
I noticed that

184
00:07:19,359 --> 00:07:21,760
you didn't talk much. Tired?

185
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,200
No.

186
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:23,880
What's this?

187
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:24,839
Go ahead and open it.

188
00:07:28,119 --> 00:07:29,079
There's even a tiny outfit.

189
00:07:31,799 --> 00:07:32,720
What is this?

190
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,720
May I open it?

191
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,200
Open it.

192
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,320
Can I come in?

193
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,119
Come in.

194
00:07:38,119 --> 00:07:38,799
I'll come in.

195
00:07:38,799 --> 00:07:39,320
Come in.

196
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:41,640
So, do you want your gift

197
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,640
today or tomorrow?

198
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,559
I'll give it to you tomorrow, okay?

199
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,239
Either works for me.

200
00:07:47,799 --> 00:07:48,640
I'll give it to you tomorrow.

201
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,519
Either works for me.

202
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,000
Are you really alright?

203
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,279
You seem

204
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,239
down today.

205
00:07:55,799 --> 00:07:57,119
Why would I be upset?

206
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:58,440
I don't know.

207
00:07:58,440 --> 00:07:59,959
You look down today.

208
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,480
I'm just sad this is our final day.

209
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,760
I can't bear to part with everyone.

210
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:05,359
Then you should join the fun
with all of us.

211
00:08:05,359 --> 00:08:05,880
Right?

212
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,600
Don't...

213
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,440
Don't bottle up your feelings.

214
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,200
Let them out if you need to.

215
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,000
We're having fun.

216
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:13,720
Is this a blind box?

217
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,720
Just open it.

218
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,640
I also have one.

219
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:23,399
Isn't this you?

220
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,279
This is me.

221
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:27,000
You need to get this outfit
on the doll first.

222
00:08:27,799 --> 00:08:29,079
These two are the same, right?

223
00:08:29,559 --> 00:08:32,159
This one is me.

224
00:08:34,239 --> 00:08:36,000
Mimicking my lame walk?

225
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,719
This is good.

226
00:08:38,719 --> 00:08:39,440
I like this.

227
00:08:41,239 --> 00:08:42,000
Interesting.

228
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,520
This is good.

229
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,960
Let me think where to hang it.

230
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,280
You...

231
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:48,320
Wait, why'd you buy this?

232
00:08:50,479 --> 00:08:51,960
Just saw it by chance.

233
00:08:52,479 --> 00:08:54,080
Did you put its clothes on backwards?

234
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:55,919
No.

235
00:08:56,359 --> 00:08:56,719
Maybe not.

236
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,280
Why is it so tight?

237
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:00,559
Why did you make it so tight?

238
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:04,479
Do you like wearing skinny pants?

239
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,880
You made it too tight.

240
00:09:11,479 --> 00:09:14,080
Hainan was full of funny moments.

241
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,840
Let me think where to hang it.

242
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,919
When I'm back in Beijing,
I'll hang it in my car.

243
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,359
Hang it in the car.

244
00:09:22,119 --> 00:09:24,479
Hang it on the rearview mirror.

245
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,359
Can't do that.

246
00:09:27,359 --> 00:09:28,880
It carries an unlucky meaning,

247
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,239
like tempting mishaps.

248
00:09:31,919 --> 00:09:33,120
Knock on wood.

249
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:34,359
No, it's not.

250
00:09:35,239 --> 00:09:35,479
No.

251
00:09:35,479 --> 00:09:36,280
I need to hang it

252
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,719
somewhere I can see it easily.

253
00:09:45,919 --> 00:09:46,640
Looks lovely.

254
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,280
It's good.

255
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,840
It matches my outfit very well.

256
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:02,919
Who to send it to?

257
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:07,280
Send it to...

258
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,440
Send it to Zhuoran.

259
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,159
(Just enjoying being playful)
He is so captivating today.

260
00:10:10,159 --> 00:10:10,840
Fine.

261
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,159
Then let me think who to send it to.

262
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:14,760
No.

263
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:15,520
I mean, what Xuan

264
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:16,440
wrote for Xiaowen

265
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,000
moved me deeply.

266
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,880
I couldn't hold back my tears
the second I heard it.

267
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,640
It moved me so much.

268
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,239
I really want to hug her.

269
00:10:27,919 --> 00:10:28,919
It's out of power.

270
00:10:29,239 --> 00:10:29,840
There's one there.

271
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,719
Yeah, I can just take it.

272
00:10:31,719 --> 00:10:33,239
No. You can't take it.

273
00:10:33,239 --> 00:10:33,719
Just sit here.

274
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:35,880
Are you sticking by my side

275
00:10:36,280 --> 00:10:38,440
to go through every word carefully?

276
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,479
I won't check now. I'll look later.

277
00:10:49,119 --> 00:10:50,119
Forget it.
I'll just go back and send it.

278
00:10:50,119 --> 00:10:50,840
It's a bit embarrassing.

279
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,039
Take the charging cable with you,

280
00:10:53,719 --> 00:10:54,880
or it'll cut out
before you finish sending.

281
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,400
I'm the last one.

282
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:17,239
Once I send it, everything's done.

283
00:11:17,719 --> 00:11:18,719
What?

284
00:11:20,239 --> 00:11:20,919
What?

285
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:22,320
Why are you taking so long to send it?

286
00:11:22,679 --> 00:11:23,919
No, I'm not that slow.

287
00:11:25,119 --> 00:11:25,960
You're way too...

288
00:11:26,479 --> 00:11:27,440
